    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1625170/extras/8d77d2f31fbc61c92af4b0c17020f98a.webp?t=1754214810\" /></div><strong>About the game:</strong> Skull Seeker is an adventure puzzle game in which you play as an explorer in a fascinating, puzzle-filled world. Your goal is to explore mysterious lands, solve complex environmental puzzles, and discover hidden secrets that will bring you closer to solving the greatest mystery - the ancient Skull.<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1625170/extras/72ee22a76995f8172a75d8127d271a5d.avif?t=1754214810\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Key features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Open world exploration</strong>: Open world exploration: Freely move through diverse and picturesque locations full of secrets and interactions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Environmental puzzles</strong>: Environmental puzzles: Use your logical thinking skills to solve puzzles and unlock further paths.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Stylized 3D graphics</strong>: Enjoy colorful and atmospheric graphics that combine charm and mystery.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Relaxing gameplay</strong>: Immerse yourself in a peaceful world full of adventures, perfect for solving puzzles at your own pace.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Single player gameplay</strong>: Perfect for players who like to explore virtual worlds on their own and discover their secrets.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Explore three islands and ancient dungeons.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1625170/extras/06fb97d76b369212ef8875ea9615c60a.poster.avif?t=1754214810\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1625170/extras/06fb97d76b369212ef8875ea9615c60a.webm?t=1754214810\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Collect hidden collectibles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1625170/extras/f75511cd9773221d5358526dc2d13e03.poster.avif?t=1754214810\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1625170/extras/f75511cd9773221d5358526dc2d13e03.webm?t=1754214810\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Avoid the traps.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1625170/extras/fd045918f25185a19231c08502de2218.poster.avif?t=1754214810\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1625170/extras/fd045918f25185a19231c08502de2218.webm?t=1754214810\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Solve environmental puzzles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1625170/extras/f061c99a7003805ec5f70576e9ff7606.poster.avif?t=1754214810\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1625170/extras/f061c99a7003805ec5f70576e9ff7606.webm?t=1754214810\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Use found items to solve puzzles</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1625170/extras/33284836acb299cdba390d7a911d4689.poster.avif?t=1754214810\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1625170/extras/33284836acb299cdba390d7a911d4689.webm?t=1754214810\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1625170/extras/26f4a17f2e96d7fa5797c5fb36855962.poster.avif?t=1754214810\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1625170/extras/26f4a17f2e96d7fa5797c5fb36855962.webm?t=1754214810\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div></p>",
